    "body": "## P0 launch-blocker\nModeration cancellation paths were marking funded `OPEN` jobs as `CANCELLED` without releasing the job escrow or expense budget. During the audit of that path, the expense escrow service was also found to ignore boolean wallet mutation results, allowing expense escrow state to advance even when the corresponding ledger operation was not applied.\n\n## Fix\n- route both moderation cancellation paths through one refunding helper\n- refund main escrow through `TransactionService.refundMoney`\n- refund expense budget through `JobExpenseService.refundAll`\n- make expense budget lock, reimbursement, unused-budget refund, and full refund fail closed when the wallet mutation reports it was not applied\n- keep all enforcement + refund mutations inside the same transaction\n- add regression coverage for moderation cancellation, account suspension across multiple jobs, expense-lock mismatch, reimbursement mismatch, and refund mismatch\n\n## Financial correctness\nAdministrative cancellation/audit/account suspension can no longer commit independently from the corresponding escrow refunds. Expense escrow records can no longer move to HELD/SETTLED/REFUNDED after a wallet-ledger mismatch.",
